data_NaCl_rocksalt_primitive
# NaCl rocksalt 2-atom primitive cell (Fm-3m, space group 225).
# Conventional lattice parameter a_conv = 5.6402 Å (room T experimental).
# Primitive cell: rhombohedral with FCC translations and a 2-atom basis.
#   Na at (0,0,0); Cl at (1/2,1/2,1/2) of conventional cubic.
# In primitive coords (rhombohedral with a' = a_conv/sqrt(2)),
# Na at (0,0,0); Cl at (1/2,1/2,1/2) of primitive cell.
# Source: Materials Project mp-22862 (NaCl, rocksalt), corroborated by
# CRC Handbook 90th ed., crystallographic data.
_cell_length_a 3.989029
_cell_length_b 3.989029
_cell_length_c 3.989029
_cell_angle_alpha 60.0
_cell_angle_beta 60.0
_cell_angle_gamma 60.0
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
